<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <title>Privacy Policy — Musterheim</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/app-icons/icon-32.png" />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --bg: #17130f;
        --card: #f3ece0;
        --card-text: #241a12;
        --card-muted: #6b5c48;
        --card-border: #d8c9ab;
        --accent: #7a1414;
        --accent-contrast: #fff6ea;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--card-text);
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      header {
        background: var(--accent);
        color: var(--accent-contrast);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      }
      header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: normal;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      h2:first-child {
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0.5rem 0;
      }
      ul {
        margin: 0.5rem 0;
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
      }
      li {
        margin: 0.3rem 0;
      }
      .meta {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--card-muted);
      }
      .meta strong {
        color: var(--card-text);
      }
      a {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      footer {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
        padding: 0 0.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #a8967d;
      }
      footer a {
        color: #c94f4f;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <h1>Musterheim — Privacy Policy</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="content">
        <p class="meta">
          <strong>Application:</strong> Musterheim<br />
          <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://musterheim.app">https://musterheim.app</a><br />
          <strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@musterheim.app">info@musterheim.app</a><br />
          <strong>Last updated:</strong> August 2026
        </p>

        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Musterheim does not require a user account.</li>
          <li>Musterheim does not collect personal information.</li>
          <li>Musterheim does not sell or share personal information.</li>
          <li>Musterheim does not use advertising.</li>
          <li>Musterheim does not use analytics or tracking SDKs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How your data is handled</h2>
        <p>
          Musterheim is a warband roster manager for the Mordheim tabletop game. It works entirely
          offline. Warbands, characters, settings, and any other application data you create are
          stored locally on your device or in your browser's local storage — never on a Musterheim
          server, because Musterheim does not operate one for your data. Nothing you enter into the
          app is transmitted anywhere.
        </p>

        <h2>Account and sign-in</h2>
        <p>
          There is no account system. You can use every feature of Musterheim without providing a
          name, email address, or any other identifying information.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising, analytics, and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          Musterheim contains no advertising, no analytics software, and no tracking SDKs of any
          kind. Your usage of the app is not measured, profiled, or shared with any third party.
        </p>

        <h2>Local storage and backups</h2>
        <p>
          Because your data lives only on your own device or browser, clearing your browser's site
          data (or uninstalling the app, if installed) may permanently delete your saved warbands
          and settings. Musterheim cannot recover this data, since it never has a copy of it. If
          you want to keep a copy of your work, use the app's built-in export feature to back up
          your data yourself.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, the "Last updated" date above will be revised accordingly.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:info@musterheim.app">info@musterheim.app</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Unofficial fan project</h2>
        <p>
          Musterheim is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project made by and for players of the
          Mordheim tabletop game. It is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored, or specifically
          approved by Games Workshop Limited.
        </p>
        <p>
          Mordheim, Warhammer, and all associated logos, names, races, vehicles, locations, weapons,
          characters, illustrations, and the distinctive likenesses thereof are either &reg;, TM,
          and/or &copy; Games Workshop Limited, variably registered in the UK and other countries
          around the world, and are used without permission.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <a href="/">&larr; Back to Musterheim</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
